4.	Backend failures and auth errors. –0.50$/month
Using query:
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(30m)
| where target contains "soc-watchtower-api.azure-api.net"
| extend statusCode = toint(resultCode)
| summarize
    total = count(),
    unauthorized = countif(statusCode in (401,403)),
    backendFailures = countif(statusCode >= 500)

